      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "FinitePrefixes defines the actual finite compatible subgroup on Fin(N+1), where N=0 is the first prose row. prefix_lift selects only a representative at the highest available row and transports it by the actual composite beta maps. No infinite record or transition surjectivity is assumed. prefix_freedom proves unique compatible kernel translation between every pair of lifts, and prefix_kernel_translation_preserves_record proves the converse action stays in the fiber.",
