      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "delta_surjective is an actual Nat.rec choice recursion on a surjective tower. Applied to the genuine row-lift defect, it produces a compatible lift. limitMap_injective, limit_kernel and the preservation-of-record theorem establish both sides of exactness rather than a one-way witness. lift_freedom gives unique transitive translations. limit_square and kernel_action_natural apply to arbitrary commuting homomorphisms, and the same general square specializes to the B/C square; there is no preferred point asserted.",
