      "id": "S4",
      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "The counterexample uses the genuine kernel of Z to ZMod(2^(n+1)); mem_A identifies it with the required power-of-two subgroup. Every row is proved exact, gamma is actual reduction and surjective, beta is identity, and record is the unique inverse of 3. Actual finite prefixes admit one integer lift. Any global compatible lift is constant and forces every power of 2 to divide 3b-1, hence 3b=1 over Z, a contradiction. The statement is transferred to the actual inverse-limit augmentation, with its B-limit identified with Z.",
