      "id": "S6",
      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "ObstructionGroup is the actual additive quotient of the full product by the range of Delta_A. chosenDefect is derived from row exactness for actual chosen row lifts. defect_class_independent proves quotient independence by kernel differences; obstructionHom proves additivity using sums of lifts; obstruction_natural covers arbitrary commuting tower maps. obstruction_zero_iff is the precise single-record criterion. Exactness at lim A/B is supplied by earlier actual-map lemmas, exactness at lim C by zero_iff, and terminal surjectivity by beta-surjectivity through delta_surjective. The same legitimate S4 tower C_0=ZMod2 and C_n=ZMod4 for n>0 has infinite kernels, nonsurjective alpha_0, yet surjective augmentation; it disproves necessity of both sufficient conditions without leaving the S4 hypotheses.",
